            "review_text": "Wolfie2010\nCounty Wicklow, Ireland384 contributions\n0\nWhat a find\nJan 2019 • Friends\nThis is a little family run restaurant not far from walking street,and it doesn’t look much from the outside.but the owners are so so nice,and the food is amazing.we had lunch and dinner there on our last day in Ho Chi Minh before leaving to travel around Vietnam,but we are going back in another week,and will be eating there again.they have a good selection of dishes,but the pho is amazing.4 of us had some spring rolls for starters between us,then a main course each,and a couple of fruit juices each,and the bill was 420,000 vnd,about $18.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2019",
